  "description": "The removal of 3 x Commscope EGYHHTT-65B-R6 antenna at 26.5m and the removal of 3 x Commscope RVVPX308.14R3 antenna at 26.5m from the existing 30m lattice tower. These will be replaced by the installation of 3 x AP-MIMO antenna at 26.79m and 3 x AP- Medium antenna at 26.10m utilising existing supporting steelwork on the tower. Ancillary works will see the removal of 9 x ERS unit, 6 x DC BoBs, 6 x feeder cables, 3 x Multicore fibre cables and 6 x DC cables. These will be replaced by the deployment of 12 x RRUs 9 x at 26.89m and 3 x at 25.78m, 3 x Ancillary small at 26m, 6 x Multicore fibre cables and refreshment works within the ground based CSC cabinet. (Cellnex/Queen Marys Hospital/COL.MOD.UK.0007545/MBCN)",
